509	    /// Assert that `TOOL_CALL_*` frames in `frames` nest properly: at most one call
510	    /// open at a time, every `TOOL_CALL_ARGS` carried by the call that is open (so
511	    /// no id's args can leak outside its own span), every `END` matching whichever
512	    /// call is open, and nothing left open by the end of the sequence.
513	    ///
514	    /// Nesting only — [`assert_tool_calls_well_formed`] is the full invariant and is
515	    /// what tests should normally use. This weaker form exists for the one ordering
516	    /// that cannot satisfy the stronger one: a delta revisiting an id whose span a
517	    /// foreign event already closed can only be rendered as a *second* span for that
518	    /// id (see `a_delta_revisiting_a_closed_id_keeps_its_args_and_its_name`).
